note draft
# Deliberately ill-typed: `add` is given a number and a text. This file exists to BE a diagnostic, so it must
# not be part of the build — `note draft` shelves it the way deck/term/CLAUDE.md documents. Without that,
# `term make` on this package reported one failure forever, which is why @term/test was on the known-broken
# list in task/term/build-all.ts.

task add-one
  take n, like number
  like number
  send back
    call add
      read n
      text <oops>
